# Visitor counter (api/visitors.go). Set these in Vercel -> Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# Required: a Redis connection string (redis:// or rediss://). Upstash, Redis Cloud, etc. all work.
REDIS_URL=rediss://default:password@host:6379
# Optional: secret used to hash visitor IPs (defaults to a hash of REDIS_URL).
VISITOR_SALT=
# Optional: extra hostnames allowed to count visitors (same-origin is always allowed).
ALLOWED_HOSTS=

# Optional Google sign-in and leaderboards (api/account.go). Without these the sign-in buttons stay hidden.
# Create an OAuth client (Web application) in Google Cloud and add https://YOUR-DOMAIN/api/auth/callback as a redirect URI.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# At least 32 random characters, used to sign session cookies (for example: openssl rand -hex 32).
SESSION_SECRET=
# Optional: the site's origin, used for the OAuth redirect (defaults to the request's host).
PUBLIC_URL=
